  "scope": "Fixed-view seated Elder eat-stew cosmetic camp cycle and once-hold playback only. No food accounting, walking sole/cane contact, other direction or seamless change between distinct activities is approved.",
  "checks": {
    "identity-and-scale": "All eight exported poses and all eight poses in the actual controlled-clock camp renderer inspected. Same bald Elder, white beard, embroidered olive coat, belt, pouches and boots. Source-bound740px standing-equivalent seated placement preserves his scale; breathing and head motion do not resize the body.",
    "station-and-foot-contact": "Both boots, stool and seated pelvis retain their fixed ground baseline throughout0-7 and7-to0. The camp root does not move. This is a seated appearance review, not material sole/cane contact calibration during travel.",
    "hand-and-tool-contact": "Left hand supports the bowl throughout the cycle. Right hand retains the spoon shaft while lifting from bowl0-1 to face2-4 and lowering5-7. The bowl stays near his lap; spoon/bowl and spoon/mouth contact positions were checked in the native exports and live frames. No hidden liquid or ingestion simulation is certified.",
    "prop-continuity": "Same wooden bowl, spoon and stool across all eight poses. No independent workstation is duplicated. Small changes in depicted food contents are cosmetic, with no resource consumption or inventory mutation.",
    "last-to-first-transition": "Frame7 lowers the spoon into the bowl and returns close to0. Spoon grip and bowl ownership remain continuous; no prop appears on the7-to0 return. Actual gameplay completes once on7, holds for two seconds and advances to a separate activity. The controlled browser review observed0-7, one completion, held handoff, terminal sequence and departure reset."
  },
